From 4fc163060a6cea5b853f04a4317cbba42ff1fcdb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 20:36:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/16] Implement xdg-activation-v1

Vendor the staging xdg-activation-v1 protocol. Tokens are minted as
"owl-<counter>" strings on commit and never validated on activate, so
any token (including a client's own guess) is accepted; that's lenient
but sufficient for a v1 implementation, and matches foot's only use of
this protocol (bell.urgent). activate resolves the target wl_surface's
role to an OwlXdgToplevel, reaching its OwlWindow through the new
-windowWrapper accessor, and brings it forward with
requestUserAttention: when the app isn't active.
