@@ -0,0 +1,211 @@
+/* This file is part of Owl.
+ *
+ * Copyright © 2019-2021 Sergey Bugaev <bugaevc@gmail.com>
+ *
+ * Owl is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it
+ * under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published
